@startuml Mail_Recovery
title ZTFramework 2.0 - Recuperação de Senha com CodeGenerator e PHPMailer

actor "Usuário" as User
participant "home.php\n(Aba Recuperar)" as View
participant "recuperarSenha.php\n(Controller)" as Controller
participant "CodeGenerator" as Gen
participant "PasswordSecurity" as Sec
participant "Usuario\n(Model)" as Model
database "Banco de Dados" as DB
participant "Mail\n(PHPMailer)" as Mail
entity "SMTP Server / Log" as SMTP

User -> View : Informa e-mail cadastrado
View -> Controller : POST /recuperar-senha { email }

Controller -> Gen : generatePassword(10)
Gen --> Controller : novaSenha (ex: 'kX8#mP2!qZ')

Controller -> Sec : hash(novaSenha)
Sec --> Controller : hashBcrypt (com Salt e Pepper)

Controller -> Model : redefinirSenhaPorEmail(email, novaSenha)
Model -> DB : UPDATE usuarios SET senha = ? WHERE email = ?
DB --> Model : OK

Controller -> Mail : quickSend(email, assunto, htmlBody)
Mail -> SMTP : Envia e-mail via PHPMailer (ou log em dev)
SMTP --> Mail : Sucesso

Controller --> View : JSON 200 { status: true, message: 'Senha enviada por e-mail' }
View --> User : Exibe mensagem de sucesso na tela

@enduml
